  "_comment": "Edge: a format sibling is NOT a version claim. dcterms:hasFormat / isFormatOf relate substantially identical content in two renderings of the SAME state, so neither triggers the §4.1 lineage-evidence requirement. Only dcterms:isVersionOf and prov:wasRevisionOf do."
